# Plan vs Execute Routing

- **Planning** (Plan mode, "plan this", scope/design before coding) → follow [plan-harness-awareness.mdc](./plan-harness-awareness.mdc).
- **Implementing an approved plan** (implement, execute, ship, build from plan) → follow [execute-from-plan.mdc](./execute-from-plan.mdc).

Do not load both full rules in the same turn. Coding turns must not pay the compact plan template.
